A state machine (DENGE, KONTROLSUZ, DUSTU) is defined. With the angle at 45°, what does this code print?

```
Durum durum = DENGE;
float aci = 45.0;
if (durum != DUSTU && fabs(aci) > 40.0) {
  durum = DUSTU;
  Serial.println("DUSTU");
}
if (durum == DENGE) Serial.println("KONTROL");
else Serial.println("MOTOR KAPALI");
```

